# Razorpay payment gateway — https://dashboard.razorpay.com > Settings > API Keys
# Aa banne set karo etle website par "PAY SECURELY ONLINE" button aave chhe ane
# payment server par auto-verify thay chhe. Set NA hoy to site juna UPI-QR + UTR
# flow par chale chhe (kai tootse nahi).
#
# ⚠️ KEY_SECRET kyarey git ma commit na karo, kyarey client code ma na nakho.
#
# Local test (PowerShell):   $env:RAZORPAY_KEY_ID='rzp_test_xxx'; $env:RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET='xxx'; npm run dev
# Production (hosting dashboard na Environment Variables ma):
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
